{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"ba1ab46e42e784cde98e7b69dca91399dcc7d758951f802d5da0412989293c76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亚伦的杖"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“你要吩咐以色列人从每个支派的首领那里拿一根杖来，共十二根，你要在上面写上他们各人的名字。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你要把亚伦的名字写在利未支派的杖上，每个支派的首领都要有一根杖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你要把这些杖放在会幕内的约柜前，就是我跟你会面的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["谁的杖发芽，谁就是我所拣选的人。这样，我必消除以色列人对你们的埋怨。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["于是，摩西吩咐以色列每个支派的首领把杖都交给他，共十二根，亚伦的杖也在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西把杖放在放约柜的圣幕里、耶和华面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二天，摩西进入约柜所在的圣幕里，看见利未支派亚伦的杖不单发了芽，长了花蕾，还开了花，结出熟杏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["摩西就从耶和华面前拿出所有的杖，给以色列人看。他们看后，各位首领便取回自己的杖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华对摩西说：“把亚伦的杖放回约柜前，让叛逆之徒引以为戒。这样，你就可以平息他们对我的怨言，使他们不致灭亡。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["摩西照耶和华的吩咐行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["以色列人对摩西说：“完了！我们死定了！我们全死定了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡走近耶和华圣幕的都要死。我们全都要灭亡吗？”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}